NOTICE 00000: depth = 3
CONTEXT: PL/pgSQL function gx_depth_trg() line 3 at RAISE
CONTEXT: SQL statement "INSERT INTO gx_depth VALUES (NEW.a + 1)"
CONTEXT: PL/pgSQL function gx_depth_trg() line 4 at SQL statement
